1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,591
Some plants make sure they self pollinate.

2
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:07,161
In homogamy the anthers and stigma ripen together.

3
00:00:07,161 --> 00:00:14,335
In cleistogamy the flowers never open at all, as in Commelina, Viola and Oxalis.

4
00:00:14,335 --> 00:00:18,138
And pea and wheat pollinate themselves while still in bud.

